[E0436] Error: `first` is used after `line`, which it borrows, was changed
    ╭─[ err/555_a_view_from_before_emptying/main.wip:24:9 ]
    │
 21 │     val first = words.words[0]
    │         ──┬──
    │           ╰──── `first` borrows `line`
    │
 23 │     line.clear()
    │     ──┬─
    │       ╰─── `line` passed as `&var` here
 24 │     assert(first == "a")
    │            ──┬──
    │              ╰──── used here
    │
    │ Help: use `first` before `line` changes, or keep a copy that owns its bytes with `String::of(…)`
    │
    │ Note: a `str` points into the bytes of what it borrows, so those must not change while the `str` is still used
────╯
